{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_title", "source_sha256": "28fd8c7eaa2b3709478cb661c5eaa3cc108693aa5dcbce7c6c62430f669b1dab", "ja": "純真Days！", "zh": "纯真Days！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0b4f08580fd580de6119e873816604e982679d9c3308b9af028bd0d191159dae", "ja": "星梨花のセンターが決まり、彼女を支えよう\nと仲間たちが集結した。ファンを楽しませる\nために出てくるアイディアの中から星梨花が\n選んだ答えは『いつも通りに』。力を出し切\nった星梨花は、ステージを成功させる。", "zh": "星梨花被选为Center，于是同伴们为了\n帮助她而聚在一起。在各种能满足粉丝的提案\n之中，星梨花选出的答案是『一切照常』。\n而全力以赴的星梨花，也顺利完成了表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1000_p", "source_sha256": "db4d98208e7694e47f26d80a9bcc0714c4e46b31c1c890b3f3e7bbbaf9b0eea7", "ja": "みんな、楽しそうだな。\n何の話だ？", "zh": "你们聊得很开心的样子呢。\n是在聊什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "87953b61708b0a92d6ad62470cc00e7eb14a5d7b0e75b86c60c00c9c4c914a58", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！　はい、\nエミリーちゃんに、イギリスのことを聞いてたんです！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n我们在问小艾关于英国的事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1002_022ser", "source_sha256": "27927452060282875e254ee28cea11fdc6ac26049c0bc3df039aba4ff5057171", "ja": "イギリスの人達は、おやつにどんなお菓子を\n食べるのか気になって……とっても勉強になりました！", "zh": "我想知道英国的人都吃什么样的点心……\n学到了很多喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1003_p", "source_sha256": "1ac04f0316f31f88197ea2f3d0d7851f648fe5643a5bff681e86123cf58910e3", "ja": "そうか、楽しそうな勉強で何よりだ。\nところで……星梨花、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "这样啊，看你学得那么开心真是太好了。\n话说回来……星梨花，方便说一下话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "3dd2d4e4dc4b3ee2ffc03fe2370dd8e63bd9231042583f8a45947df8d85eab7f", "ja": "？　わたしに、何かご用ですか？", "zh": "嗯？请问找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1005_p", "source_sha256": "37fb3c1efe7f736f4914c75e01cea6a6f4d4d25eec59096fb2a41d07e1bff712", "ja": "ああ。今度また劇場の公演があるんだけど、その\nセンターを、星梨花にやってもらうことになった。", "zh": "就是啊，又要举办剧场公演了，\n这次我想让星梨花来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "d3f6d60221e79f58144d8caf25e4bbe29ea38539475a2a8fef0888db4e12c58f", "ja": "センターって……\nわ、わたしが、真ん中で歌うってことですか！？", "zh": "Center是指……\n我、我要站在正中间唱歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1007_032emi", "source_sha256": "a31bb8a20f8a71149d717119d7a2c3e96f903871cc6816b77eb1b56ce1d83856", "ja": "Wow！　星梨花さん、すごいです！", "zh": "Wow！星梨花，好棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "561616d4893005e5ac145095b99d4369b57517215184d2a384ec5d7d89dfc3e7", "ja": "むむ……先越されちゃった。\nでも、おめでとう、星梨花。", "zh": "唔……被抢先了。\n不过恭喜你，星梨花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "17f224409fa09aa9cbf755f9cc8411b605c6a390cb4fc60b516930c99cf162e9", "ja": "えっと、その……\n本当に、わたしでいいんですか……？", "zh": "那个，该怎么说……\n我真的可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1010_p", "source_sha256": "32f5d49f98a24d063e1080a4ad2a378552d197d98bb0e1c717685b6274bfd312", "ja": "ああ。初めてのセンターで緊張するかもしれないけど、\n今の星梨花なら、できると信じてる。頑張ろう！", "zh": "是啊，第一次当Center虽然会很紧张，\n但我相信现在的星梨花一定没问题，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_007_1011_022ser", "source_sha256": "d695d638fb55a03e4aa6021f66cdb8ea691d6e2631d12d2bf8469c10e8e94ed0", "ja": "はっ……はい！　あの、{$P$}さん！\nわたし、頑張りますっ！", "zh": "好……好的！那个，{$P$}先生！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
